WEBVTT

00:17:00.792 --> 00:17:03.213
It's where you find the humanity,

00:17:03.237 --> 00:17:05.111
and it's where you find the truth.

00:17:06.121 --> 00:17:08.229
And Tony said to me,

00:17:08.253 --> 00:17:12.125
"Jon, could I buy you a drink in a bar?

00:17:12.149 --> 00:17:15.449
I just want to thank you
for everything you've done for me."

00:17:15.473 --> 00:17:16.764
And I didn't go.

00:17:17.674 --> 00:17:19.494
What would you have done?

00:17:20.501 --> 00:17:21.853
Thank you.

00:17:21.877 --> 00:17:28.524
(Applause)